  "pool": "paper",
  "stem": "In triangle \\(PQR\\), angle \\(R\\) is a right angle, \\(\\sin P = \\frac{11}{61}\\), and \\(PR = 120\\). What is the length of \\(\\overline{QR}\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "22"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(\\sin P = \\frac{QR}{PQ} = \\frac{11}{61}\\), so let \\(QR = 11k\\) and \\(PQ = 61k\\).",
    "Then \\(PR = \\sqrt{(61k)^{2} - (11k)^{2}} = 60k\\).",
    "\\(60k = 120\\), so \\(k = 2\\) and \\(QR = 22\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "k=symbols('k',positive=True)\nkk=solve(Eq(sqrt((61*k)**2-(11*k)**2),120),k)[0]\nans=11*kk\nassert ans==22\nassert all(Rational(s)==ans for s in spr_answers)\n",
